// THE KARAMBWAN SPOTS - five spawn points offering Fish, which answered nothing.
//
// Tai Bwo Wannai Trio ends by handing over a karambwan vessel and the quest's own completion panel
// lists "Karambwan fishing" as the reward, and that reward worked only one way: dropping the loaded
// vessel from your inventory inside a zone off the east coast. The three spot records the maps place
// (lubufu_karambwan, 0_45_48_karambwan, general_karambwan) carried one op and no category, so the
// obvious thing - clicking Fish on the spot the fish are in - did nothing at all.
// tools/silentnpcops.py listed all five points; this is them answering.
//
// ONE CLICK, ONE DROP, and that is the cache's own shape: these records carry op1=Fish and no hidden
// continuation op, so there is nothing for a repeating fishing clock to be driven through - unlike
// every other spot in this directory, which has a spare op for exactly that. So the Fish op does
// what the vessel does: one drop, one roll, the karambwanji gone either way.
//
// THE SPOT IS THE DEEP WATER, so it does not repeat the vessel's zone check. Dropping the vessel by
// hand has to ask where you are standing; clicking a karambwan spot has already answered that.
//
// The level, the rates, the experience and the bait all stay where they were - quests/quest_tbwt/
// scripts/quest_tbwt.rs2, which this jumps into - so there is one karambwan catch in the build and
// not two that can drift apart.

[opnpc1,_karambwan]
if (inv_total(inv, tbwt_karambwan_vessel_loaded_with_karambwanji) > 0) {
    @tbwt_karambwan_drop;
}
if (inv_total(inv, tbwt_karambwan_vessel) > 0) {
    ~mesbox("The vessel is empty. It wants a karambwanji in it - the little bright ones, netted in the village.");
    return;
}
~mesbox("Something dark green is down there and it is not going to be netted, hooked or harpooned. Lubufu, on the Brimhaven jetty, is the man who knows how.");

[opnpcu,_karambwan]
switch_obj(last_useitem) {
    case tbwt_karambwan_vessel_loaded_with_karambwanji : @tbwt_karambwan_drop;
    case tbwt_karambwan_vessel : ~mesbox("The vessel is empty. It wants a karambwanji in it.");
    case default : @fishing_wrong_spot_message(last_useitem);
}
